  "id": "BIT-sqlite-2026-119375",
  "summary": "SQLite before 3.54.0 Information Disclosure via WAL Page Size Mismatch",
  "details": "SQLite before 3.54.0 contains an information disclosure vulnerability that allows attackers to read uninitialized page-cache memory by supplying a WAL file with an undersized page size. Attackers can craft a database and WAL file whose oversized record payload makes queries like substr() return stale bytes, disclosing other table rows and internal pointers.",
